{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15398,\"date\":\"2026-06-11T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-09T20:32:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-controllo-touch-diretto-sidecar\",\"title\":\"macOS 27 porta il controllo touch diretto su Sidecar\",\"excerpt\":\"Con macOS 27 Sidecar introduce il controllo touch diretto: un passo avanti per usare iPad come estensione del Mac con interazioni più immediate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macos-sidecar-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-sidecar\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15411,\"date\":\"2026-06-10T21:57:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-10T19:57:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-golden-gate-segnala-app-attive-in-background-dopo-chiusura\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: Golden Gate segnala le app che restano attive in background dopo la chiusura\",\"excerpt\":\"Con macOS 27, Golden Gate mette in evidenza le app che continuano a restare attive in background anche dopo la chiusura, aiutando a individuare comportamenti non desiderati.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macos-27-app-background-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-27-app-background\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15368,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T19:57:55+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-golden-gate-mac-compatibili-intel-fine-supporto\",\"title\":\"macOS Golden Gate: ecco i Mac compatibili e cosa cambia con Intel\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha presentato macOS Golden Gate al WWDC 2026. L’aggiornamento conferma la fine del supporto ai Mac Intel e indica quali modelli Apple silicon potranno installarlo.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macOS-Golden-Gate-Mac-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Golden-Gate-Mac\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15314,\"date\":\"2026-06-05T11:14:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-05T09:14:21+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-wishlist-wwdc-2026-siri-multitasking\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: la wishlist per WWDC 2026 (Siri, multitasking e altro)\",\"excerpt\":\"A pochi giorni dalla keynote WWDC 2026, l’attenzione si allarga anche a macOS 27: Siri, app dedicata, Liquid Glass, multitasking, supporto display esterni e gestione della memoria.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macOS-27-Wishlist-What-Do-You-Want-From-Apple-at-WWDC-2026-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-Wishlist-What-Do-You-Want-From-Apple-at-WWDC-2026-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15312,\"date\":\"2026-06-05T11:14:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-05T09:14:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"novita-in-arrivo-con-macos-27\",\"title\":\"5+ novità in arrivo con macOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Tra redesign di Liquid Glass, un Siri più evoluto su Mac e aggiornamenti AI per Foto, Safari e Strumenti di scrittura: ecco le principali novità attese in macOS 27.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/5-New-Features-Coming-in-macOS-27-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"5-New-Features-Coming-in-macOS-27-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15273,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-manca-una-settimana-placeholder-youtube-keynote-diretta\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026, manca una settimana: placeholder YouTube e keynote in diretta\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dall’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple ha attivato un placeholder su YouTube con promemoria per il keynote del 8 giugno. La diretta sarà disponibile anche su Apple Events e Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15267,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:14:47+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:14:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-nuova-app-siri-dedicata\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: arriva la nuova app Siri dedicata\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 debutta per la prima volta un’app Siri standalone: uno spazio dedicato per conversare, cercare sul web e usare dati personali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Finder-Siri-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Finder-Siri-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15249,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T09:30:14+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-28-piu-significativo-di-ios-27-rumor-gurman\",\"title\":\"iOS 28 sarà “più significativo” di iOS 27: il rumor di Gurman\",\"excerpt\":\"Mark Gurman parla di iOS 28 come di un aggiornamento “far more significant” rispetto a iOS 27, senza però entrare nei dettagli. iOS 28 sarebbe incentrato su un nuovo iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Low-Angle-iPhone-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Low-Angle-iPhone-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15230,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T17:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6 e tvOS 26.6. Arrivano due giorni dopo le beta per sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15152,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-26-6-prima-beta-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.6: prima beta disponibile per sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia la prima beta di macOS Tahoe 26.6 agli sviluppatori. L’aggiornamento arriva due settimane dopo Tahoe 26.5 e richiede l’abilitazione delle Beta Updates.\",\"categoryName\":\"macOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"macos\",\"categoryId\":100,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15132,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T15:45:05+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T15:48:07+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macbook-ultra-5-novita-attese\",\"title\":\"MacBook Ultra: 5 novità attese per il nuovo top di gamma Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor e report indicano un possibile “MacBook Ultra” sopra il Pro: OLED ibrido, touch sul display, design più sottile, Dynamic Island e chip M6 Pro/M6 Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/MacBook-Ultra-5-Expected-Features-That-Could-Justify-the-Name-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Ultra-5-Expected-Features-That-Could-Justify-the-Name-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15123,\"date\":\"2026-05-24T15:13:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-24T13:13:28+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prepara-genai-apple-com-in-vista-del-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara genai.apple.com in vista del WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Spunta il sottodominio genai.apple.com su DNS Apple, in anticipo sul WWDC 2026. Non risulta ancora collegato a una pagina attiva.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T16:00:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-siri-riprogettato-accessibilita-ios-27\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026: Siri riprogettato e nuove funzioni di accessibilità in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple conferma WWDC 2026 (8-12 giugno). Attese novità su iOS 27, con un Siri ripensato, funzioni di accessibilità e aggiornamenti per iOS 27 e altri sistemi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15039,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T09:44:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:47:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-didascalie-automatiche-video-personali-iphone\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: didascalie automatiche per i video personali su iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità: iOS 27 può generare automaticamente didascalie per i video personali, con supporto iniziale in inglese.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15037,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T08:30:11+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:46:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-voice-control-linguaggio-naturale-upgrade-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: Voice Control con linguaggio naturale e upgrade Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple aggiorna Voice Control su iPhone e iPad con supporto al linguaggio naturale tramite Apple Intelligence. Funzione disponibile inizialmente in inglese in alcuni Paesi.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15019,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T18:30:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:59:44+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuove-funzioni-accessibilita-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple annuncia aggiornamenti accessibilità basati su Apple Intelligence per VoiceOver, Magnifier, Voice Control e Accessibility Reader, con sottotitoli generati e controllo carrozzina su Vision Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14974,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T14:30:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:06:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-programma-wwdc-2026-inviti-media\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica il programma di WWDC 2026 e invia inviti ai media\",\"excerpt\":\"WWDC 2026 si terrà dal 8 al 12 giugno. La keynote inizierà alle 10:00 PT (1:00 ET) e sarà disponibile in streaming su Apple.com, Apple TV e YouTube.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/wwdc-apple-park-in-person-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"wwdc-apple-park-in-person\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14906,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T15:30:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:56:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"oled-ipad-mini-data-uscita-prezzo-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"OLED iPad mini: data di uscita, prezzo e cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, Apple sarebbe vicina a lanciare l’iPad mini di nuova generazione con chip A19 Pro e display OLED, oltre a un design più resistente all’acqua.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/ipad-mini-7-blue-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ipad-mini-7-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14896,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T10:45:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:53:16+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-valuta-azioni-legali-contro-apple-partnership-tesa-siri\",\"title\":\"OpenAI valuta azioni legali contro Apple per la partnership “tesa” con Siri\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, OpenAI starebbe valutando opzioni legali contro Apple per una partnership con Siri giudicata “tesa”, con integrazione e promozione ritenute insufficienti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/OpenAI-vs-Apple-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"OpenAI-vs-Apple-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14778,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T14:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:57:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-piu-di-50-vulnerabilita-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Aggiornamento iOS 26.5: più di 50 vulnerabilità di sicurezza corrette\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato iOS 26.5 e iPadOS 26.5 con oltre 50 correzioni di sicurezza. Nessun bug risulta sfruttato attivamente, ma è consigliato aggiornare.\",\"categoryNam